Z||000012||FieroKyle||08-10-2001||02:53 PM||||Those probably won't work because they are for the DMC 12 De Lorean. I have a cup holder that grips the window on the inside and it works great. Since the Fiero windows always leave 1/4 inch up all the way down, you can always use it. However since I got it I have only used it once.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Phil||08-10-2001||06:39 PM||||Zip on down to your nearby boating supply store and get 2 $5.99 black or white folding cupholders and screw one onto the instrument surround and the other one to the radio surround. They are the exact same style as the $90 Delorean jobbies. I see one potential problem with console mounted holders and that is the passenger can very easily smack them whilst moving their legs.||||reg||1
